	<div id="col-1198425647" class="col medium-6 small-12 large-6"  >
				<div class="col-inner"  >
			
			
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Rise Residential Ltd is an <strong>owner-operated, residential building company</strong> based in Christchurch, providing building services across South Island including the surrounding areas of Christchurch &amp; Selwyn.  </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We build and <span style="color: #00aeef;"><a style="color: #00aeef;" href="https://www.riseresidential.co.nz/building-services-christchurch/renovation/">renovate homes</a></span> all over Christchurch and Selwyn, specialising in all forms of residential construction including new builds, extensions, <span style="color: #00aeef;"><a style="color: #00aeef;" href="https://www.riseresidential.co.nz/building-services-christchurch/renovation/bathroom/">bathroom </a></span>and <span style="color: #00aeef;"><a style="color: #00aeef;" href="https://www.riseresidential.co.nz/building-services-christchurch/renovation/kitchen/">kitchen renovations</a></span>, as well as bespoke<span style="color: #00aeef;"> <a style="color: #00aeef;" href="https://www.riseresidential.co.nz/building-services-christchurch/architectural-services/">residential architect services</a>.</span></span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We believe in <strong>professionalism</strong>, <strong>honesty</strong>, and <strong>integrity</strong>. We provide open, clear lines of communication with our clients and maintain strict schedules and deadlines. We pride ourselves on the high quality of our work we deliver.</span></p>
<a href="/about-us/" class="button primary reveal-icon" >
		<span>Read more</span>
	<i class="icon-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>

		</div>
					</div>

	
</div>
