	</div>
	
	<div id="text-148517777" class="text">
		
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We have over 20 years of practical experience in renovating homes. Whether it be a new </span><span style="color: #00aeef;"><a style="color: #00aeef;" href="/"><span style="font-weight: 400;">bathroom</span></a></span><span style="font-weight: 400;">, </span><span style="color: #ff9900;"><a style="color: #ff9900;" href="/"><span style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="color: #00aeef;">kitchen</span></span></a></span><span style="font-weight: 400;">, or adding a new storey to your existing home, we have the experience and manpower to make the process quick and cost effective. </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">Rise Residential will renovate your home to the highest standards, adhering to bespoke interior designs that you will be proud to call home. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We have an adundance of satisfied, happy customers and we love what we do, treating all our client’s homes with the respect and care we would bring to our own. We cannot wait to help you realise your dreams!</span></p>
		
<style>
#text-148517777 {
  font-size: 1rem;
  text-align: left;
}
</style>
	</div>
	
<a href="/building-services-christchurch/renovation/" class="button primary reveal-icon" >
		<span>Read more</span>
	<i class="icon-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>

