    font-size: 1rem;
    text-align: left;
  }
}
</style>
	</div>
	
	<div id="text-4250551849" class="text">
		
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Our builders work directly with you and the homeowner throughout the entire planning, design, construction and post-evaluation phases of the project. This process enables continuity and transparency of between us for your <a href="https://www.riseresidential.co.nz/building-services-christchurch/new-builds/"><span style="color: #00aeef;">new house build</span></a>. We are flexible in our approach to house building and can work with local councils and your preferred subcontractors.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Our aim is to provide people from all walks of life the opportunity to build a home specifically tailored to their tastes, lifestyle and budget to Master Builders standards in Christchurch, Selwyn &amp; Waimakariri. Your new home is a major financial investment and we will work very hard to make you dreams come true within your budget.</span></p>
		
<style>
#text-4250551849 {
  font-size: 1rem;
  text-align: left;
}
</style>
