}
</style>
	</div>
	
	<div id="text-1165429133" class="text">
		
<p style="font-weight: 400;">We are <span style="color: #00aeef;"><a style="color: #00aeef;" href="https://www.riseresidential.co.nz/cost-calculator/">home extension specialists</a></span>, whether you need more bedrooms, an ensuite, a garage, or a little extra living space, we can help!</p>
<p style="font-weight: 400;">As your family grows, your home needs to grow as well. Rather than packing up and moving somewhere else, extending your home is a practical solution to the growing pains as your life gets a little bigger.</p>
<p style="font-weight: 400;">We work with you to develop a plan that blends your dreams with practical solutions that will add value and functionality to your home. Get in touch with the team today and get the ball rolling on your home extension tomorrow.</p>
		
<style>
#text-1165429133 {
  font-size: 1rem;
  text-align: left;
}
</style>
