    width: 6%;
  }
}
</style>
	</div>
	
	<div id="text-1055095772" class="text">
		
<h2>House Builders Christchurch</h2>
		
<style>
#text-1055095772 {
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  text-align: center;
}
@media (min-width:550px) {
  #text-1055095772 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
}
@media (min-width:850px) {
  #text-1055095772 {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
}
</style>
	</div>
	
	<div id="text-3909800632" class="text">
		
<p>We pride ourselves as Christchurch&#8217;s premier house builders, delivering quality craftsmanship combined with catering to the unique needs of each of our clients. With broad experience covering the Christchurch and Selwyn regions, our team is very good at building homes not only structurally sound but beautifully designed to suit the local environment.</p>
<p>Our commitment to professionalism, transparency, and timeliness in all we do means no project falls below expectation from conceptualisation to completion. Whether you build your dream home or extend your current living space, Rise Residential is your preferred partner in Christchurch.</p>
<h3 style="font-size: 2rem;">Home Construction</h3>
<p>The construction of a home is more than just walls and a roof; it&#8217;s about creating an environment that personifies one&#8217;s lifestyle, values, and aspirations. From initial design to final finishing touches, we guide you through the process at Rise Residential to ensure your new home is built to all of your specifications.</p>
<p>Local building regulations and sustainable practices are well within our expertise, ensuring your home is not only beautiful but built to last. We can assist you in managing home construction stressors and focusing on quality to ensure that the client is satisfied, thereby making the journey of coming up with a new home interesting.</p>
		
<style>
