<p><i>&#8220;We employed Ben to undertake repairs on our home after a recommendation from a friend. We have been most impressed with both his workmanship and his level of contentiousness. He communicates his intentions well, is on time and completes paperwork such as quotes in a timely manner. I would highly recommend.&#8221;</i></p>
