<div class="row"  id="row-1659572604">

	<div id="col-597498807" class="col medium-6 small-12 large-6"  data-animate="fadeInLeft">
				<div class="col-inner"  >
			
			
	<div id="text-1352046264" class="text">
		
<h2>More About Us</h2>
		
<style>
#text-1352046264 {
  font-size: 1.4rem;
}
@media (min-width:550px) {
  #text-1352046264 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }
}
@media (min-width:850px) {
  #text-1352046264 {
    font-size: 2rem;
  }
}
</style>
	</div>
	
<p><i>&#8220;Ben from Rise Residential was wonderful to deal with, very good with giving options and explaining the processes of our renovations along the way. We are so pleased with the end result and couldn’t recommend Ben and Rise Residential enough if you are looking to build or renovate.&#8221;</i></p>
<p class="strong">&#8211; Lauren Tulitt</p>
		</div>
					</div>

	

	<div id="col-2077210525" class="col medium-6 small-12 large-6"  >
				<div class="col-inner"  >
			
			
<p><strong>Rise Residential Ltd is an owner-operated Professional &amp; Experienced Christchurch Builder based in Canterbury that specializes in all forms of residential construction including renovations, new builds and property maintenance. We employ experienced people who are friendly, courteous and produce good quality results that we can be proud of.</strong></p>
<p>At Rise Residential we believe in such basics as professionalism, honesty and integrity. We provide open, clear lines of communication with our clients, and maintain strict schedules and deadlines. We pride ourselves in the high quality of our work.</p>
<p>Whether the job is big or small, we will consult with our client to ensure we meet their needs, wants and budget outcomes. We have excellent relationships with consultants, subcontractors and suppliers to ensure a high quality of work is carried across all trades.</p>
<a href="/about-us" class="button primary reveal-icon" >
		<span>Read more</span>
	<i class="icon-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>

		</div>
					</div>

	
</div>
<div class="row"  id="row-1600772823">

	<div id="col-145195532" class="col small-12 large-12"  >
				<div class="col-inner"  >
			
			
<div class="is-divider divider clearfix" style="max-width:100%;height:2px;"></div>
		</div>
					</div>

	

	<div id="col-1293304334" class="col medium-6 small-12 large-6"  data-animate="fadeInLeft">
				<div class="col-inner"  >
			
			
	<div id="text-1143320558" class="text">
		
<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
		
<style>
#text-1143320558 {
  font-size: 1.4rem;
}
@media (min-width:550px) {
  #text-1143320558 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }
}
@media (min-width:850px) {
  #text-1143320558 {
    font-size: 2rem;
  }
}
</style>
	</div>
	
		</div>
					</div>

	

	<div id="col-408824914" class="col medium-6 small-12 large-6"  >
				<div class="col-inner"  >
			
			
<div class="accordion">
	<div id="accordion-2587069462" class="accordion-item">
		<a id="accordion-2587069462-label" class="accordion-title plain" href="#accordion-item-what-guarantees-do-you-offer?" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-2587069462-content">
			<button class="toggle" aria-label="Toggle"><i class="icon-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
			<span>What Guarantees do you Offer?</span>
		</a>
		<div id="accordion-2587069462-content" class="accordion-inner" aria-labelledby="accordion-2587069462-label">
			
<p>All our projects come with the comprehensive Master Build Guarantee, giving you peace of mind that your investment is protected and the quality of work is upheld to the highest standards.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	
	<div id="accordion-453777662" class="accordion-item">
		<a id="accordion-453777662-label" class="accordion-title plain" href="#accordion-item-how-to-plan-a-major-home-renovation?" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-453777662-content">
			<button class="toggle" aria-label="Toggle"><i class="icon-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
			<span>How to Plan a Major Home Renovation?</span>
		</a>
		<div id="accordion-453777662-content" class="accordion-inner" aria-labelledby="accordion-453777662-label">
			
<p>Planning a major home renovation can seem overwhelming, but with the right approach, it becomes manageable and even enjoyable. Start by defining your goals and budget, then consult with professionals to discuss your vision and get expert advice. Develop a detailed plan, including timelines and key milestones. Ensure all necessary permits are obtained before work begins. Communication is key, so stay in touch with your builder throughout the project. At Rise Residential, we guide you through each step, ensuring a smooth and successful renovation experience.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	
	<div id="accordion-816607509" class="accordion-item">
		<a id="accordion-816607509-label" class="accordion-title plain" href="#accordion-item-how-much-does-it-cost-to-build-a-new-home?" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-816607509-content">
			<button class="toggle" aria-label="Toggle"><i class="icon-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
			<span>How Much Does It Cost to Build a New Home?</span>
		</a>
		<div id="accordion-816607509-content" class="accordion-inner" aria-labelledby="accordion-816607509-label">
			
<div class="flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full">
<div class="min-h-&#091;20px&#093; text-message flex flex-col items-start whitespace-pre-wrap break-words &#091;.text-message+&amp;&#093;:mt-5 juice:w-full juice:items-end overflow-x-auto gap-2" dir="auto" data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="edee2ed5-be0c-4687-a5f2-52a7ee168ade">
<div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 juice:empty:hidden juice:first:pt-&#091;3px&#093;">
<div class="markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light">
<p>The cost of building a new home varies on several factors, including the size of the home, the design complexity, the materials chosen, and the location. At Rise Residential, we tailor our services to fit your budget and preferences. To get a more accurate estimate, we recommend scheduling a consultation with our team. We can provide a detailed quote based on your specific needs and help guide you through the planning process to ensure you get the best value for your investment.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	
	<div id="accordion-1030527546" class="accordion-item">
		<a id="accordion-1030527546-label" class="accordion-title plain" href="#accordion-item-what-is-master-build?-how-does-the-master-build-guarantee-work?" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-1030527546-content">
			<button class="toggle" aria-label="Toggle"><i class="icon-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
			<span>What is Master Build? How does the Master Build Guarantee work?</span>
		</a>
		<div id="accordion-1030527546-content" class="accordion-inner" aria-labelledby="accordion-1030527546-label">
			
<p>Rise Residential Ltd are a member of the Master Builders Association, meaning our work is covered by the Master Build Guarantee. This will be provided to you as an option in the building contract and can protect you against loss of deposit, non-completion of the build, defects in materials, workmanship, and structural integrity. Cover will depend on the value of the building contract. For more information on your Master Build Guarantee refer to <a href="http://www.masterbuilders.org.nz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.masterbuilders.org.nz&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1723253358007000&amp;usg=AOvVaw14h3SVXcHfOAS7z8645kpp">www.masterbuilders.org.nz</a> and the terms of your Residential Building Contract.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	
	<div id="accordion-3066128473" class="accordion-item">
		<a id="accordion-3066128473-label" class="accordion-title plain" href="#accordion-item-can-i-make-changes-once-construction-has-started?" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-3066128473-content">
			<button class="toggle" aria-label="Toggle"><i class="icon-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
			<span>Can I make changes once construction has started?</span>
		</a>
		<div id="accordion-3066128473-content" class="accordion-inner" aria-labelledby="accordion-3066128473-label">
			
<div class="flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full">
<div class="min-h-&#091;20px&#093; text-message flex flex-col items-start whitespace-pre-wrap break-words &#091;.text-message+&amp;&#093;:mt-5 juice:w-full juice:items-end overflow-x-auto gap-2" dir="auto" data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="edee2ed5-be0c-4687-a5f2-52a7ee168ade">
<div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 juice:empty:hidden juice:first:pt-&#091;3px&#093;">
<div class="markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light">
<p>This will depend on the nature of the changes, as they can affect council consented plans. Non-structural changes are usually no issue and can be achieved with a minor variation to the contract. Larger changes may require an amendment to the building consent.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	
	<div id="accordion-541748814" class="accordion-item">
		<a id="accordion-541748814-label" class="accordion-title plain" href="#accordion-item-what-insurances-do-i-require?" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-541748814-content">
			<button class="toggle" aria-label="Toggle"><i class="icon-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
			<span>What insurances do I require?</span>
		</a>
		<div id="accordion-541748814-content" class="accordion-inner" aria-labelledby="accordion-541748814-label">
			
<div class="flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full">
<div class="min-h-&#091;20px&#093; text-message flex flex-col items-start whitespace-pre-wrap break-words &#091;.text-message+&amp;&#093;:mt-5 juice:w-full juice:items-end overflow-x-auto gap-2" dir="auto" data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="edee2ed5-be0c-4687-a5f2-52a7ee168ade">
<div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 juice:empty:hidden juice:first:pt-&#091;3px&#093;">
<div class="markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light">
<p style="font-weight: 400;">Renovation or extension contract works insurance is generally organised and taken care of by the homeowner through your own insurance company. For new builds, Rise Residential Ltd will manage the insurance, with the value of the insurance to be included in the building works contract. Once the home is handed over to you, the insurance will lapse, and your private home insurance will take over.</p>
<p style="font-weight: 400;">Rise Residential Ltd carries public liability insurance cover for the duration of the build period.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	
</div>
		</div>
					</div>

	
</div>
